    "title": "Zero plus n, by induction",
    "blurb": "myAdd 0 n = n: a base case, a step case and an induction hypothesis.",
    "watch": "In the succ case, ih arrives in the context, then rw [ih] spends it.",
    "theorem": "zero_myAdd (n : Nat) : myAdd 0 n = n",
    "leanVersion": "4.34.1"
  },
  "source": "namespace ZeroAdd\n\ndef myAdd : Nat → Nat → Nat\n  | n, 0     => n\n  | n, m + 1 => myAdd n m + 1\n\ntheorem zero_myAdd (n : Nat) : myAdd 0 n = n := by\n  induction n\n  case zero => rfl\n  case succ k ih =>\n    rw [myAdd]\n    rw [ih]\n\nend ZeroAdd\n",
